{"id":29414,"slug":"graduation","title":"Graduation","year":2016,"country":"Romania","duration":127,"spine":924,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/29414-graduation","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/c9145bb4bfe7ea206fb22d923bb14c5f/CkfZqo0bw9C0qo84byxkWdKPbFteoQ_large.jpg","description":"Blending rigorous naturalism with the precise construction of a thriller, this Cannes award–winning drama from Cristian Mungiu sheds light on the high stakes and ethical complexities of life in contemporary Romania. As his daughter nears high-school graduation, Romeo (Adrian Titieni), an upstanding doctor, counts on her securing a competitive scholarship that will send her to university in England. But when an injury sustained during a sexual assault compromises her performance on an important exam, Romeo’s best-laid plans for her threaten to crumble, leading him to seek favors in a world that runs on back-scratching and bribery. Suffused with quiet dread, Graduation takes a humane and deeply ambiguous look at how corrosive rampant corruption is to moral convictions.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Cristian Mungiu","slug":"cristian-mungiu"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Adrian Titieni","role":"Romeo","slug":"adrian-titieni"},{"actor":"Maria Drăguș","role":"Eliza","slug":"maria-dragus"},{"actor":"Lia Bugnar","role":"Magda","slug":"lia-bugnar"},{"actor":"Mălina Manovici","role":"Sandra","slug":"malina-manovici"},{"actor":"Vlad Ivanov","role":"Chief inspector","slug":"vlad-ivanov"},{"actor":"Rareș Andrici","role":"Marius","slug":"rares-andrici"},{"actor":"Petre Ciubotaru","role":"Vice-mayor Bulai","slug":"petre-ciubotaru"},{"actor":"Gelu Colceag","role":"Exam committee president","slug":"gelu-colceag"},{"actor":"Alexandra Davidescu","role":"Romeo’s mother","slug":"alexandra-davidescu"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Cristian Mungiu","slug":"cristian-mungiu"},{"role":"Written by","person":"Cristian Mungiu","slug":"cristian-mungiu"},{"role":"Pr